#. module: bf_editorial_audience
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_editorial_audience.action_editorial_palmares_brut
msgid ""
"Sorted on Odoo's native counter, which counts everything that comes through,"
" bots included. It is kept as is because what it contained is unknown, and "
"it is not corrected retroactively. For a ranking with bots removed, see "
"Audience."
msgstr ""
"Trié sur le compteur natif d'Odoo, qui compte tout ce qui\n"
"                passe, robots compris. Il est gardé tel quel parce qu'on ne\n"
"                sait pas ce qu'il contenait, et il n'est pas corrigé\n"
"                rétroactivement. Pour un classement d'où les robots sont\n"
"                retirés, voir Audience."

#. module: bf_editorial_audience
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_editorial_audience.field_bf_editorial_entry__audience_bot
msgid "The bots Odoo's list does not name."
msgstr "Les robots que la liste d'Odoo ne nomme pas."

#. module: bf_editorial_audience
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_editorial_audience.field_bf_editorial_audience__bot_views
msgid ""
"The bots Odoo's list does not name: meta-externalagent, Barkrowler, "
"DataForSeo, python-requests, Go-http-client, Scrapy and the others that say "
"neither bot nor crawl."
msgstr ""
"Les robots que la liste d'Odoo ne nomme pas : meta-externalagent, "
"Barkrowler, DataForSeo, python-requests, Go-http-client, Scrapy et les "
"autres qui ne disent ni bot ni crawl."

#. module: bf_editorial_audience
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_editorial_audience.action_editorial_palmares_brut
msgid "The historical ranking"
msgstr "Le palmarès historique"

#. module: bf_editorial_audience
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_editorial_audience.field_bf_editorial_entry__audience_unknown
msgid ""
"The honesty bucket: everything that could not be read, including all visits "
"from before the capture went live."
msgstr ""
"Le seau de l'honnêteté : tout ce qu'on n'a pas su lire, y compris toutes les"
" visites d'avant la mise en service de la capture."

#. module: bf_editorial_audience
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:bf_editorial_audience.action_editorial_audience
msgid ""
"The snapshot freezes each day before the visitor purge wipes its traces. It "
"starts saying something useful the day after it goes live: earlier visits "
"have no recorded agent and count as such. Mind the wording: \"tracked "
"views\" is already filtered by Odoo, which refuses to track any agent that "
"calls itself a bot. The raw figure is the post's native counter."
msgstr ""
"Le relevé fige chaque journée avant que la purge des visiteurs\n"
"                n'emporte ses traces. Il commence à dire quelque chose d'utile\n"
"                le lendemain de sa mise en service : les visites d'avant n'ont\n"
"                pas d'agent relevé et comptent comme telles.\n"
"                Attention au vocabulaire : « vues retenues » est déjà filtré\n"
"                par Odoo, qui refuse de tracer tout agent qui se nomme robot.\n"
"                Le brut, c'est le compteur natif du billet."

#. module: bf_editorial_audience
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_editorial_audience.field_website_visitor__user_agent
msgid ""
"The string declared by the client, kept in clear so the history can be "
"reclassified when a new bot appears. The "
"bf_editorial_audience.ua_retention_days parameter sets how long it is kept."
msgstr ""
"La chaîne déclarée par le client, gardée en clair pour pouvoir reclasser "
"l'historique quand un robot nouveau apparaît. Le paramètre "
"bf_editorial_audience.ua_retention_days règle sa durée de conservation."

#. module: bf_editorial_audience
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bf_editorial_audience.field_bf_editorial_audience__tracked_views
msgid ""
"The views Odoo agreed to track. This is NOT the raw figure: Odoo itself "
"drops from website.track any agent containing bot, crawl, slurp, spider, "
"curl, wget and eight other substrings. The true raw figure is the post's "
"native counter."
msgstr ""
"Les vues qu'Odoo a bien voulu tracer. Ce n'est PAS le brut : Odoo écarte "
"lui-même de website.track tout agent contenant bot, crawl, slurp, spider, "
"curl, wget et huit autres sous-chaînes. Le vrai brut est le compteur natif "
"du billet."

